{
  "name": "VK Review Attention",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Purpose\\nUses an LLM to decide whether a completed coding-agent execution deserves human review attention, then stores that decision back in Vibe Kanban.\\n\\nUse this as a reference for combining Vibe Kanban execution events with LLM classification. The workflow only evaluates coding-agent executions and produces a structured `reviewAttention` payload.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 450,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "review-attention-note",
      "name": "Workflow Description",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "eventTypes": [
          "execution_completed"
        ],
        "schemaVersion": "vk_n8n_orchestration_v1"
      },
      "id": "vk-trigger",
      "name": "VK Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-vibe-kanban.vibeKanbanTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "vibeKanbanMqtt": {
          "name": "Local VK MQTT"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "execution",
        "executionProcessId": "={{$json.refs.executionContext.executionProcessId}}"
      },
      "id": "vk-read-execution",
      "name": "Read Execution Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-vibe-kanban.vibeKanbanRead",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "vibeKanbanApi": {
          "name": "Local VK API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "run-reason",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.execution.run_reason}}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "rightValue": "coding_agent"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "coding-agent-filter",
      "name": "Only Coding Agent Executions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "task-id",
              "name": "taskId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.scope.task.id}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "workspace-id",
              "name": "workspaceId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.scope.workspace.id}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "execution-id",
              "name": "executionProcessId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.execution.id}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "task-description",
              "name": "taskDescription",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.coding_agent_turn && $json.coding_agent_turn.prompt ? $json.coding_agent_turn.prompt : ($json.scope.task.description || $json.scope.task.title)}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "agent-summary",
              "name": "agentSummary",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.coding_agent_turn && $json.coding_agent_turn.summary ? $json.coding_agent_turn.summary : ''}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "execution-context",
              "name": "executionContext",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{JSON.stringify($json, null, 2)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "review-attention-input",
      "name": "Build Review Attention Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        980,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{`Analyze whether the completed work successfully addresses the original task.\n\n## Original Task\n${$('Build Review Attention Input').item.json.taskDescription}\n\n## Agent's Work Summary\n${$('Build Review Attention Input').item.json.agentSummary}\n\n## Execution Context\n${$('Build Review Attention Input').item.json.executionContext}\n\n## Your Role\nYou are reviewing whether the task objective was achieved. Check BOTH:\n1. Did the agent report any problems or failures?\n2. Does the work actually address what the original task requested?\n\n## NEEDS ATTENTION if ANY of these are true:\n\n### Agent-reported problems:\n- Errors or failures that weren't resolved\n- Work that is incomplete or partially done\n- Blockers encountered\n- Tests failing\n- Uncertainty about correctness\n\n### Task completion issues:\n- The work does NOT address the original task objective\n- The agent did something tangential (e.g., answered a question but didn't fix the underlying problem)\n- The summary describes work that doesn't match what the task asked for\n- The task requested a fix/implementation but the agent only investigated/explained\n\n## Does NOT need attention if:\n- The work directly addresses what the task requested\n- The agent completed the actual objective (not just related activities)\n- No problems or concerns are mentioned by the agent\n\n## IMPORTANT - Do NOT flag attention for:\n- Normal configuration requirements (env vars, parameters to set)\n- Suggestions for future improvements or additional testing\n- Standard deployment steps\n- Your own hypothetical concerns about the code\n- Things the agent did NOT mention as problems\n\nKey question: Did the agent complete what the task actually asked for, or just do something related?\n\nReturn only JSON with this shape:\n{\"needs_attention\": true, \"reasoning\": \"brief explanation\"}`}}",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "review-attention-chain",
      "name": "Ask Review Attention LLM",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        1270,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini"
        },
        "responsesApiEnabled": true
      },
      "id": "review-attention-model",
      "name": "Review Attention Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1270,
        120
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "Local OpenAI"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"needs_attention\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"reasoning\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"needs_attention\",\"reasoning\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}"
      },
      "id": "review-attention-parser",
      "name": "Review Attention Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1470,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "task-id",
              "name": "taskId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$('Build Review Attention Input').item.json.taskId}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "workspace-id",
              "name": "workspaceId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$('Build Review Attention Input').item.json.workspaceId}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "execution-id",
              "name": "executionProcessId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$('Build Review Attention Input').item.json.executionProcessId}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "needs-attention",
              "name": "needsAttention",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "={{$json.output.needs_attention}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "reasoning",
              "name": "reasoning",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$json.output.reasoning}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-review-attention",
      "name": "Build Review Attention Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1550,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "reviewAttention",
        "operation": "createReviewAttention",
        "taskId": "={{$json.taskId}}",
        "workspaceId": "={{$json.workspaceId}}",
        "executionProcessId": "={{$json.executionProcessId}}",
        "needsAttention": "={{$json.needsAttention}}",
        "reasoning": "={{$json.reasoning}}"
      },
      "id": "vk-create-review-attention",
      "name": "Create Review Attention",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-vibe-kanban.vibeKanbanAction",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1820,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "vibeKanbanApi": {
          "name": "Local VK API"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "VK Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Execution Context",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Execution Context": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Only Coding Agent Executions",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Only Coding Agent Executions": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Review Attention Input",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Build Review Attention Input": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask Review Attention LLM",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Review Attention Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask Review Attention LLM",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Review Attention Output Parser": {
      "ai_outputParser": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Ask Review Attention LLM",
            "type": "ai_outputParser",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Ask Review Attention LLM": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Build Review Attention Payload",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Build Review Attention Payload": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create Review Attention",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
